[00:12.76]1. Because Jehovah created
[00:25.82]The universe so grand,
[00:29.82]To him belong the earth and sky,
[00:33.82]The works of his own hand.
[00:37.82]The breath of life he has given
[00:44.92]And to his creatures shown
[00:51.32]That worthy is he to have the praise,
[00:58.12]The worship of all his own.
[01:12.96]2. In water Jesus was baptized
[01:18.96]To righteousness fulfill.
[01:24.96]In solemn prayer he said to God:
[01:31.96]‘I’ve come to do your will.’
[01:38.40]When he came up from the Jordan
[01:45.00]As God’s anointed Son,
[01:51.40]Obedient and loyal he would pray:
[01:58.40]‘My Father, your will be done.’
[02:17.85]3. We come before you, Jehovah,
[02:24.15]To praise your name so great.
[02:30.45]Disowning self, with humble hearts,
[02:37.10]Our lives we dedicate.
[02:43.10]You gave your only begotten,
[02:49.10]Who paid the price so high.
[02:56.54]No longer as living for ourselves,
[03:03.44]For you we will live or die.